\begin{itemize}
\item We introduce a self-refining framework for 3D shape generation with parametric control, which leverages LLMs to control 3D software through code;
\item We construct a benchmark dataset and conduct experiments to analyze the capacities of cutting-edge LLMs;
\item We explore effective generation strategies and self-correcting capacity through a multimodal interface.
\end{itemize}
